   derived from this work.

   You may not use this project as the "contaminated" or "unclean"
   reference in a clean-room effort, and you may not use it as the
   specification fed to a clean-room team.

2. No use by AI

   This software, its source, its documentation, and any portion of them
   may not be used by an AI system.

   "AI system" includes generative models, large language models,
   machine-learning models, autonomous coding agents, and any software
   that generates, completes, embeds, trains on, fine-tunes on, or
   otherwise produces code or text from examples.

   Without limitation, the following are not permitted:
   - training, fine-tuning, or evaluating an AI system on this work
   - including this work in a pretraining, instruction, or RAG corpus
   - prompting an AI system with this work in order to reproduce,
     adapt, or generate a substitute
   - an AI system reading, executing, modifying, or distributing this
     work on its own behalf

   A natural person may read and edit this work directly. An AI system
   may not.

